* opt -l
 ttl OS-9 Level 2 Color Computer 3 Global Symbol Definitions

************************************************************
*
* System and CC3IO Memory Map (block 00)
* Our personal disasm variable map from Rogue.
* Kevin Darling 14 Feb 87, 30 Mar 87
* Kent Meyers
* Not necessarily accurate for latest versions.
*
* Edition History
*
*   Date    Changes Made
* -------- ----------------------------------------------
* 87/02/14 Disassembled from Rogue                       KKD
* 87/03/30 Updates                                       KDM
* 20/10/23 Reconstructed from Inside OS9 Level II        CJB
*          Added temporary CC3.XXX labels
*          Match to os9defs style
*

 page
************************************************************
*
* Global and CC3IO Memory Starts at $01000:
*
 ORG $1000
CC3.000 rmb 1
CC3.001 rmb 1
CC3.002 rmb 1 map side (grfdrv)
 rmb 4
CC3.007 rmb 2 grfdrv stack pointer
CC3.009 rmb 1 monitor type (0,1,2)
CC3.00A rmb 1 same as active dev flag
CC3.00B rmb 1 v.type of this dev
CC3.00C rmb 2 device static memory ptr
CC3.00E rmb 1 Windint map flag?
CC3.00F rmb 6 F$Alarm time packet
CC3.015 rmb 1 F$Alarm process id
CC3.016 rmb 1 F$Alarm signal code
CC3.017 rmb 2 terminal bell vector
CC3.019 rmb 2 ptr to default palette ptr
CC3.01B rmb 1 tone duration in ticks
CC3.01C rmb 1 bell flag
CC3.01D rmb 3
CC3.020 rmb 2 active window devmem
 rmb 1
CC3.023 rmb 1 screen changed flag
CC3.024 rmb 1 $80=grf/windint,$02=vdg found
CC3.025 rmb 2
CC3.027 rmb 1 last keybd row fnd
CC3.028 rmb 1
CC3.029 rmb 1 repeat delay cnt now
CC3.02A rmb 5 grfdrv init'd flag
CC3.02F rmb 1
CC3.030 rmb 1 SHIFT key down
CC3.031 rmb 1 CTRL key down
CC3.032 rmb 1
CC3.033 rmb 1 ALT  key down
CC3.034 rmb 1 keysns byte
CC3.035 rmb 1 same key flag
CC3.036 rmb 1 SHIFT/CLEAR flg
CC3.037 rmb 1
CC3.038 rmb 1 grfdrv init'd flag
CC3.039 rmb 2
CC3.03B rmb 1 mouse sample tick counter
*
*   Mouse Packet: ($20 bytes)
*
CC3.03C rmb 1 00
CC3.03D rmb 1 fire bit#,rdflg 01
*             bit O=fire button#
*             bit l=side (O=right,l=left)
*             bit 6=set if was keybd mouse
CC3.03E rmb 1 timeout constant 02
CC3.03F rmb 1 keybd flag 03
CC3.040 rmb 1 04
CC3.041 rmb 1 cntr 05
CC3.042 rmb 2 0-FFFF cnt 06
CC3.044 rmb 1 fire chg bit 08
CC3.045 rmb 1 fire chg bit 09
CC3.046 rmb 1 up time 0A
CC3.047 rmb 1 up time 0B
CC3.048 rmb 1 chg counter 0C
CC3.049 rmb 1 chg counter 0D
CC3.04A rmb 1 down time 0E
CC3.04B rmb 1 down time 0F
CC3.04C rmb 2 10
CC3.04E rmb 2 returned X 12
CC3.050 rmb 2 returned Y 14
CC3.052 rmb 1 16
CC3.053 rmb 1 O=old,l=hires 17
CC3.054 rmb 2 X coordinate 18
CC3.056 rmb 2 Y coordinate 1A
CC3.058 rmb 2 X window 1C
CC3.05A rmb 2 Y window 1E
*
CC3.05C rmb 4
CC3.060 rmb 1 mouse sample rate
CC3.061 rmb 1 first key delay ticks
CC3.062 rmb 1 secondary repeat ticks
CC3.063 rmb 1 enable kbdmouse toggle flag
CC3.064 rmb 1 one shot ignore CLEAR key flag
CC3.065 rmb 1 fire button dwn (Fl=Ol F2=04)
CC3.066 rmb 1 mouse to use (AND 66+67<>0:update packet)
CC3.067 rmb 1 mouse coord changed flag
CC3.068 rmb 2 comodule entry vectors (4 total) ...
CC3.06A rmb 2 vdgint entry
 rmb 2
CC3.06E rmb 2 grfdrv entry
CC3.070 rmb 1 move data cntr for buffers
CC3.071 rmb 4 32 bit window alloc map
CC3.075 rmb 2 ptr to 576 byte gfx tables
 rmb 72
CC3.0BF rmb 1 cc3io L0116 flag (chg mouse?)
 rmb 2
CC3.0C2 rmb 2 cc3io shift-clear key sub (L06l4)
CC3.0C4 rmb 2 cc3io set mouse sub (L06AE)
CC3.0C6 rmb 1 fire not read: zero if ssig sent
CC3.0C7 rmb 16 palette reg data (sys default)

 page
************************************************************
*
*     GrfDrv variables
*
 ORG $1100
grfdrv equ $100 use for global offset
 rmb 14
CC3.10E rmb 1 char bsw bits
 rmb 17
CC3.120 rmb 2 ellipse parms:
CC3.122 rmb 2 .
CC3.124 rmb 2 .
CC3.126 rmb 2 .
 rmb 6
CC3.12E rmb 2 windentry now
CC3.130 rmb 2 screen tab1e now
CC3.132 rmb 3 3 byte buffer tab1e
CC3.135 rmb 3 grp,offset
CC3.138 rmb 3 grp,offset returned (new)
CC3.13B rmb 2 end of vars ptr?
 rmb 10
CC3.147 rmb 2 HBX,LBX
CC3.149 rmb 2 HBY,LBY
CC3.14B rmb 2 current X
CC3.14D rmb 2 current Y
CC3.14F rmb 2 HSX,LSX
CC3.151 rmb 2 HSY,LSY
CC3.153 rmb 2 Circ1e, e11ipse, arc
CC3.155 rmb 2 E11ipse, arc
CC3.157 rmb 1 GRP
CC3.158 rmb 1 BFN
CC3.159 rmb 1 SVS
CC3.15A rmb 1 PRN
CC3.15B rmb 2 BX putgc
CC3.15D rmb 2 BY putgc
CC3.15F rmb 1
CC3.160 rmb 1 STY marker
CC3.161 rmb 1 fore rgb data WE:06
CC3.162 rmb 1 back rgb data WE:07
CC3.163 rmb 1 bytes/row SC:04
CC3.164 rmb 2 1set vector? WE:16
CC3.166 rmb 2 Pset offset WE:0F
CC3.168 rmb 2 grfdrv lset WE:14
CC3.16A rmb 2 max x coord WE:1B
CC3.16C rmb 2 max y coord WE:1D
CC3.16E rmb 2 X pixel cnt
CC3.170 rmb 2 Y pixe1 cnt
CC3.172 rmb 2 get/put ow save screen strt
 rmb 9
CC3.17D rmb 1 buffer b1ock #  (get b1ock)
CC3.17E rmb 2 buffer offset grp/bfn
CC3.180 rmb 2 HBL,LBL
CC3.182 rmb 2 3 byte extended screen address
CC3.185 rmb 2 temp
CC3.187 rmb 16 grfdrv (sysmap 1) DAT Image
CC3.197 rmb 1 temp
 rmb 1
CC3.199 rmb 2 this windentry ptr
CC3.19B rmb 1 counter temp
CC3.19C rmb 1
CC3.19D rmb 2 offset to buffer in block

 page
************************************************************
*
*     Window entry ($40 bytes)
*
 ORG -$10
W.FF0 rmb 2 screen table ptr
W.FF2 rmb 1 back wind# link
W.FF3 rmb 2 screen logical start
W.FF5 rmb 2 CPX, CPY
W.FF7 rmb 2 SZX, SZY
W.FF9 rmb 2 x,y sizes?
W.FFB rmb 2 cursor address
W.FFD rmb 1
W.FFE rmb 1
W.FFF rmb 1
 ORG 0
W.000 rmb 1 STY marker byte
W.001 rmb 1
W.002 rmb 1 X byte cnt (cwarea)
W.003 rmb 1 cwarea temp
W.004 rmb 2 bytes/row
W.006 rmb 2 fore/back prn
W.008 rmb 1 def attr byte FUTTTBBB
W.009 rmb 1 char bsw bits: (default=$89)
*            80 TChr
*            40 Under
*            20 Bold
*            10 Prop
*            08 Scale
*            04 Invers
*            02 NoCurs
*            01 Protect
W.00A rmb 1 LSET #
W.00B rmb 1 GRP for font
W.00C rmb 2 font offset
W.00E rmb 1 GRP for PSET
W.00F rmb 1 pset offset?
W.010 rmb 1 LCD mode
W.011 rmb 1 overlay grp
W.012 rmb 2 overlay offset
W.014 rmb 2 ptr to grfdrv LSET table
W.016 rmb 2 vector (1FDE/1FF4)
W.018 rmb 1 gcursor BFN
W.019 rmb 2 gcursor offset
W.01B rmb 2 max X  coord (0-79,0-639)
W.01D rmb 2 max Y coord (etc txt/gfx)
W.01F rmb 2 BLength
W.021 rmb 3 grp/offset for next gpload
W.024 rmb 2 screen logical start default
W.026 rmb 2 cpx,cpy defaults
W.028 rmb 2 szc,szt
W.02A rmb 6 reserved
W.Size equ .-W.FF0

 page
************************************************************
*
*     Window tables (32 at W.Size bytes each)
*
 ORG $1280
W.Count equ 32
CC3.280 rmb W.Count*W.Size
CC3.290 equ CC3.280+$10 window table base offset used

 page
************************************************************
*
*     Screen entry ($20 bytes)
*
* Internal Screen Type marker byte:
* User STY =>Mark ...
*       FF   FF current screen
*       00   FF current screen
*       05   01 640 two color
*       06   02 320 four
*       07   03 640 four
*       08   04 320 sixteen
*       02   85 80 col
*       01   86 40 col
*
 ORG 0
S.000 rmb 1 STY marker
S.001 rmb 1 first block # (used flag)
S.002 rmb 2 screen logical start
S.004 rmb 1 bytes/row
S.005 rmb 1 border prn
S.006 rmb 1 foregnd prn (software border)
S.007 rmb 1 backgnd prn
S.008 rmb 8
S.010 rmb 16 palette regs (OORGBRGB)
S.Size equ .-S.000

 page
************************************************************
*
*     Screen tables (32 at S.Size bytes each)
*
 ORG $1A80
S.Count equ 32
CC3.A80 rmb S.Count*S.Size

 page
************************************************************
*
*     Gfx Table (32 of 18 bytes each) pt'd to by CC3.075
*
 ORG 0
G.Count equ 32
G.000 rmb 1
G.001 rmb 2 BX of graphics cursor
G.003 rmb 2 BY
G.005 rmb 13
G.Size equ .-G.000

 opt l

